<title>JAPAN: Hodogaya Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hodogaya Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.42		vs	   14.90</p>
<p> Operating	prft 338 mln	  vs   loss 309    mln</p>
<p> Current	  prft 259 mln	  vs   loss 796    mln</p>
<p> Net	    loss 72    mln	  vs     loss 1.08</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 1.09 yen	  vs    loss 16.16 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     67 million	  vs	  67 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hodogaya Chemical Co Ltd is a chemical maker affiliated with Tosoh Corp.</p>
